'''Type of feat''': Epic 

'''Prerequisite''': [[Ambidexterity]] or [[Dual-wield]], [[Greater two-weapon fighting]], and a [[Dexterity]] of 25 or higher

'''Specifics''': You have mastered fighting with two weapons. You can make as many [[attacks per round|attacks]]  with the off-hand as you can with your main hand. 

'''Use''':  Automatic

